<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to {{clubName}}</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10B981 0%, #059669 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .header p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }
    .highlight-box {
      background: #F0FDF4;
      border-left: 4px solid #10B981;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .highlight-box h2 {
      margin: 0 0 12px 0;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #059669;
    }
    .highlight-box p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #166534;
    }
    .info-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 15px;
      margin: 25px 0;
    }
    .info-card {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    }
    .info-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #64748B;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .info-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #1E293B;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .steps {
      margin: 25px 0;
    }
    .step {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .step-number {
      background: #10B981;
      color: #fff;
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 700;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-right: 15px;
    }
    .step-content h3 {
      margin: 0 0 5px 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #1E293B;
    }
    .step-content p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #64748B;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #10B981;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 20px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .button:hover {
      background: #059669;
    }
    .button-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #64748B;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .footer p {
      margin: 5px 0;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #10B981;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Welcome to {{clubName}}!</h1>
      <p>We're thrilled to have you join our swimming community</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear {{firstName}} {{lastName}},</p>

      <p>Thank you for registering with {{clubName}}! We're excited to welcome you to our swimming family.</p>

      <div class="highlight-box">
        <h2>Your Account is Ready</h2>
        <p>You can now log in to your parent portal to manage your family's swimming activities, view schedules, and track progress.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-grid">
        <div class="info-card">
          <h3>Your Email</h3>
          <p>{{email}}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <h3>Account Role</h3>
          <p>{{role}}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 style="color: #1E293B; margin-top: 35px;">Next Steps</h2>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">1</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>Log In to Your Portal</h3>
            <p>Access your family dashboard to view schedules, sessions, and important updates.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">2</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>Add Your Members</h3>
            <p>Register your children and assign them to appropriate squads based on their skill level.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">3</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>Set Up Direct Debit</h3>
            <p>Complete your payment setup to ensure uninterrupted access to sessions and facilities.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">4</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>Complete Consent Forms</h3>
            <p>Review and provide necessary consents for photography, medical treatment, and other activities.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="button-container">
        <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="button">Go to Parent Portal</a>
      </div>

      <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-top: 35px; background: #FEF3C7; border-left-color: #F59E0B;">
        <h2 style="color: #D97706;">Need Help?</h2>
        <p style="color: #92400E;">If you have any questions or need assistance getting started, please don't hesitate to reach out to our team. We're here to help!</p>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 30px;">We look forward to seeing you and your members at the pool!</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
        Best regards,<br>
        <strong>{{clubName}} Team</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} {{clubName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>Need help? <a href="{{supportUrl}}">Contact Support</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
